      "t": "ev",
      "d": 0,
      "s": "gap4-06-bj-law-2026",
      "n": "Ordinary short-tourist visitors are subject to the statutory visa requirement. Tourist/visit visas are issued online. Passport must have more than six months remaining at application; provide accommodation and a ticket ensuring departure, except when entering in one’s own vehicle. The issued visa determines the actual stay, within the 90-day tourist ceiling. If cumulative stays exceed 90 days, the decree requires a printed visa or passport sticker; that condition is not assumed satisfied. Residence, official-status and individually granted exemptions are outside this ordinary non-resident baseline.",
      "stay": "Tourist/visit visa: up to 90 days, according to the grant; renewal for the same stay period is permitted by the decree.",
      "label": "Tourist eVisa; cumulative-stay qualification"
    },
